          {
            "id": "s2_4",
            "speaker": "MAN",
            "text": "Well, let's go for the February date then.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s2_5",
            "speaker": "ANGELA",
            "text": "So that's the weekend beginning the 4th.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s2_6",
            "speaker": "MAN",
            "text": "OK. Now can you tell me a bit about what conference facilities you have?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s2_7",
            "speaker": "ANGELA",
            "text": "Sure. So for talks and presentations we have the Tesla room.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s2_8",
            "speaker": "MAN",
            "text": "Sorry?",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          },
          {
            "id": "s2_9",
            "speaker": "ANGELA",
            "text": "Tesla - that's spelled T-E-S-L-A. it holds up to a hundred people, and it's fully equipped with a projector and so on.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 0
          }
